# Sunrise Gen AI — design system

`DESIGN-SYSTEM-LOCKED.md` at the repository root is authoritative. The December 2024
Orbitron / neon lock is void; do not restore it.

## Palette

`--void #000816` · `--void-deep #00040D` · `--sun #D9661C` · `--hot #FAC345` ·
`--teal #06B6C3` · `--bone #F2EDE4` · `--ink #0A0C10`, plus off-white text.
Never `#00F5FF`, `#FF6B35`, `#FFD23F`.

## Type

Self-hosted from `public/fonts`, committed to the repo, SIL OFL:

- Display / wordmark / headings: **Cormorant Garamond** (variable 300–700 + italic)
- Body / labels / UI: **Source Serif 4** (variable 200–900), 16–18px

No Orbitron. No Geist, Inter, IBM Plex, Arial, `system-ui`, or any default SaaS
grotesque as the page voice. No runtime request to fonts.googleapis.com — `@font-face`
lives in `src/app/globals.css`.

## Page order

Fold → 01 What we do (pinned offers rail + capability matrix) → 02 OpenStinger →
03 Ingre (light chapter, device scan + Fig. 03 pipeline schematic) → 04 Media (a full
chapter on content generation) → 05 Contact.

Hero headline is **"Enterprise GenAI, built to run."** with the subline *Agents,
retrieval, and data platforms in production.* The old line "Production systems for
operations and messy knowledge" is dead — do not restore it, and keep the phrase
"messy knowledge" out of the hero.

## Content rules

- This is **Sunrise Gen AI LLC selling to enterprises**, not a personal site. Write
  capabilities as offers, never as a career history. No résumé timeline, no
  years-of-experience count, no personal certifications, no "I led". A principal may be
  named in the footer only.
- Never present a past employer as a Sunrise engagement or case study — including
  Verizon, Cognizant, Circana, Interas, Thermo Fisher, Persistent, CVS, Change
  Healthcare, McDonald's. They are personal employers, not Sunrise clients. Do not
  invent Sunrise clients either.
- Outcome claims are limited to *up to 60% less time on schema and mapping work* and
  *3× throughput on attribute mapping*, framed as what we deliver.
- **Ingre must stay on the page** and is written as a pitch: "Scan food and beauty
  labels. See harmful ingredients." Android and iOS. ingre.ai. Never write, for Ingre:
  Play testing, Google testing, Mac Studio, Flutter, "in development", or LabelSaber.
- Media is a real chapter: content generation with image, text, and video models for
  marketing materials, campaigns, and web content. Never a film reel, named short films,
  or a portfolio of student shorts.
- Diagrams are original and drawn in the house language — hairline grid, bordered
  stations, small caps labels, corner ticks, travelling packets. No stock icons, no
  illustration packs, no photography of people.
- Never write: a Gmail address, Hyderabad, a film reel or named short films,
  Job Book, Swaram, Lensort, parked domains, PBL, or study forks.
- Contact is West Palm Beach, FL · sbellary@sunrisegenai.com · 440-340-8383.
  Public location lock (27 Aug 2026): project West Palm Beach, FL to the world.
  Do not write Wellington. Do not put a street address on the public page.

## Build

Next.js App Router with `output: 'export'`. `npm run build` must pass and the existing
GitHub Pages workflow must keep deploying without changes.
